# JasperReports Anti-Patterns

## Hardcoding SQL in JRXML — bypasses Ebean

```xml
<!-- WRONG -->
<queryString>SELECT * FROM product</queryString>
```

**Use JRBeanCollectionDataSource with Java objects. Let Ebean handle queries.**

## Loading .jrxml from classpath at runtime — slow

```java
// WRONG — compiles JRXML every time
JasperCompileManager.compileReport(inputStream);
```

**Compile at build time, ship .jasper binary.**

## No parameter validation — NPE in report

```java
// WRONG — parameter might be null
$P{startDate}.toString();
```

**Always check: `$P{startDate} != null ? $P{startDate} : "N/A"`**